},{"w":"Can’t","s":110.58,"e":110.82,"line":38},{"w":"buy","s":111.06,"e":111.26,"line":38},{"w":"this","s":111.26,"e":111.82,"line":38},{"w":"guy.","s":111.82,"e":112.2,"line":38}],"lines":[{"s":4.18,"e":4.9,"text":"Yeah—"},{"s":4.9,"e":7.34,"text":"Can’t buy the sky,"},{"s":7.34,"e":10.34,"text":"Can’t buy this guy."},{"s":13,"e":26.8,"text":"Campaign clean, hands high."},{"s":26.8,"e":29.85,"text":"I’m a bribe-free politician, no envelope edition,"},{"s":30.24,"e":33.42,"text":"No backroom handshake, no dirty coalition."},{"s":33.42,"e":37.12,"text":"They said, “Name your price,” I said, “Name your mission,”"},{"s":37.12,"e":40.56,"text":"I don’t sell my soul for a lobbyist’s commission."},{"s":40.56,"e":44.04,"text":"I walk in the chamber with a clean-cut vision,"},{"s":44.1,"e":47.44,"text":"Receipts on the table, full transparency living."},{"s":47.52,"e":50.88,"text":"You can’t buy my vote, can’t rent my conviction,"},{"s":50.88,"e":54.4,"text":"I’m built too solid for the soft corruption system."},{"s":54.4,"e":54.48,"text":"You can’t buy the sky,"},{"s":54.4,"e":57.76,"text":"You can’t buy this guy,"},{"s":57.76,"e":61.22,"text":"No cash in the bag, no silk-tie lie."},{"s":61.22,"e":65.68,"text":"I’m a bribe-free politician with the stars in my eye,"},{"s":65.68,"e":69.12,"text":"If the truth costs my crown, let the crown go bye."},{"s":69.28,"e":71.1,"text":"Diamonds on the moon? Yeah, I seen that shine,"},{"s":71.1,"e":72.84,"text":"But I don’t trade the people for a donor’s wine."},{"s":72.84,"e":74.48,"text":"No golden parachute, no billionaire leash,"},{"s":74.48,"e":76.22,"text":"I’m feeding the block while they auction the peace."},{"s":76.22,"e":77.94,"text":"I sign no secrets, I kiss no ring,"},{"s":77.94,"e":79.68,"text":"I don’t dance for the throne, I don’t bow to the king."},{"s":79.62,"e":81.38,"text":"From the city hall steps to the galactic floor,"},{"s":81.38,"e":83.06,"text":"I’m the one they can’t purchase at the cosmic store."},{"s":83.06,"e":84.78,"text":"They can buy the ads, they can buy the spin,"},{"s":84.78,"e":86.56,"text":"They can buy fake friends with a lobbyist grin."},{"s":86.56,"e":88.28,"text":"But they can’t buy courage, they can’t buy soul,"},{"s":88.28,"e":90.32,"text":"They can’t buy fire when the heart’s pure gold."},{"s":90.32,"e":90.59,"text":"You can’t buy the sky,"},{"s":90.58,"e":92.34,"text":"You can’t buy this guy,"},{"s":92.34,"e":97.46,"text":"No cash in the bag, no silk-tie lie."},{"s":97.46,"e":101.9,"text":"I’m a bribe-free politician with the stars in my eye,"},{"s":101.9,"e":105.28,"text":"Clean hands to the heavens, let the whole world fly."},{"s":105.28,"e":106.16,"text":"No bribes."},{"s":106.2,"e":107.04,"text":"No chains."},{"s":107.04,"e":110.42,"text":"No price tag on my name."},{"s":110.42,"e":110.58,"text":"Can’t buy the sky—"},{"s":110.58,"e":112.2,"text":"Can’t buy this guy."}],"duration":122.84,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-06-17T12:24:27.175Z","stats":{"whisperWords":311,"polishedWords":308,"matched":269,"matchRate":0.873}}